@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# Qwen3.5 device initialization
+
+The optional stream used to overlap shared and routed experts is created only
+on NVIDIA. AMD retains its existing inline path, and Ascend uses the model
+stream. An Ascend deployment must not instantiate `torch.cuda.Stream` from a
+CPU PyTorch build with the NPU extension.
+
+The regression test constructs a real, minimal Qwen3.5 model on the meta device
+in an Ascend environment. This tests initialization without allocating model
+weights or launching kernels. The full checkpoint smoke run separately covers
+weight loading and subsequent runtime behavior.
+
+This guard also appears in the group's frozen HW1 adaptation. The rebuild
+reproduces the failure and adds focused regression coverage; it does not claim
+the original adaptation as a new contribution.
